SUMMARY:Little Conestoga Watershed Alliance - Volunteer Riparian Buffer Planting
DESCRIPTION:We hope you can join us for this Volunteer Riparian Buffer Planting Event on Saturday\, November 14th from 9:00 am – 12 Noon at Overlook Park. This event is sponsored by Manheim Township\, The Penn State Ag & Environment Center\, and the Litte Conestoga Watershed Alliance (LCWA). Please register using the link below. After clicking on the link\, you must create an account with Penn State Extension first if you don’t already have an account\, and then select the “Lancaster Event”.\n\nREGISTRATION LINK: LCWA Volunteer Buffer Planting Registration\n\nPlease contact me if you have any questions or issues registering. Mark Huber\, LCWA\, Secretary\, mhuberlarch@live.com 
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/little-conestoga-watershed-alliance-volunteer-riparian-buffer-planting/
LOCATION:Overlook Park\, 595 Granite Run Dr.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17601\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Little Conestoga Watershed Alliance":MAILTO:lcwa@mail.com
END:VEVENT
